        "id": "audit-options-nested-external-call-command-copy",
        "status": "first_pass",
        "assessment": "Full-template Copy uses cleaned parameters and publishes exact unescaped text. Paste strips Python whitespace then splits literal spaces, retaining raw rows and quote fragments; the exact unsorted count/summary review handles zero, one, blank/repeated, Unicode/C0, tab/newline and truncated many-argument cases. No/close keep the draft; Yes updates executable/raw rows and cleaned example. Copy/accepted paste show Copied!/Pasted! feedback. Missing clipboard text opens owned Error/ok with No text on the clipboard!; access failures do not mutate the draft. Child Apply cleans arguments; parent Apply persists them, with reopened saved Process.command preserving literals/Unicode and substituting tokens. Parent Cancel and retired reviews cannot publish.",
